{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "That ends our coverage of the Lord's game. A rather lopsided affair, which was quite unexpected. England were bland in all aspects of the game and paid the price. However, we all know how potent they can be when they get their act right and they will be hungry to bounce back. On the other hand, Pakistan were astute overall. They will look to capitalize on the dream start and continue their form. Join us for the second and final Test of the series from the 1st of June in Headingley, Leeds. Till then, cheers!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The Man of the Match has been awarded to Mohammad Abbas for his terrific performance with the ball. He was in his elements from the word go and took a 8-wicket haul to push the Englishmen on the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Trailing by 179, the pressure was immense on the batters of the English team and it further escalated as they lost Cook and Stoneman cheaply. Though, Root played a captain's innings and scored his 40th Test fifty but he failed to make it big. Buttler and Bess then delayed the inevitable with a big seventh wicket partnership (126 runs) and pushed the game into the fourth day. Nonetheless, Pakistan came out with better plans today and the new ball helped them in a big way. Overall, it was a great team effort from the subcontinent team and they were the deserving winners.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "After winning the toss, England decided to bat under the overcast conditions, but the home team was rocked early as they lost three quick wickets. However, Cook tried to resurrect the innings with a half century but the hosts were bundled out for a paltry total of 184 in their first essay with the bat. In reply, Pakistan batted smartly, they assessed the conditions better than the hosts. Azhar Ali, Asad Shafiq, Babar Azam and Shadab Khan scored their respective fifties while the rest chipped in as they went on to post 363. Ben Stokes did give his heart out with the ball but it didn't prove enough to give his team the upper hand.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "An emphatic win for Pakistan, they have cruised along without breaking a sweat in this run chase. 64 was never going to challenge the visitors, but the way their young batsmen handled it was noteworthy. Haris Sohail was the aggressor of the two, while Imam played the second fiddle in the 54-run unbeaten stand which saw them get over the line. However, the game was set up by their bowlers earlier in the session. Abbas and Amir wreaked havoc. The two complimented each other well and snared eight wickets combined in this innings. Abbas was the pick of the bowlers for Pakistan, the right-arm pacer took a 8-wicket haul and his efforts played a big role in Pakistan winning this game. This is also the second consecutive win for Pakistan at the Mecca of Cricket, Lord's.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,335,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "FOUR! That is that! Game, set and match! PAKISTAN WIN BY 9 WICKETS! They take a 1-0 lead in the series. A friendly delivery from Bess. Full toss on the middle and leg stump line, the batsman whips it with absolute ease to the mid-wicket boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Fuller length ball on off, Haris goes on the front foot and defends it on the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Looks to defend that one, but misses it as that one keeps low.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,335,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "SIX! S-H-O-T! Haris tonks one into the stands. A low full toss, he goes down on one knee and slogs it over the mid-wicket boundary for a biggie. That's the 50-run stand between Sohail and Imam!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Stays tall and gets behind the line to block it.", "Summary": {"Score": "56/1", "Over": "12", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63084", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "34", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "27042", "Runs": "29", "Balls": "28", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "The batsman picked the bouncer early and lets it through to the keeper.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "6,253,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Consistent short bowling from the English pacer. Imam gets another one into his body and punches the ball down to the mid off region for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,349,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "The batsman stays tall and keeps it down to the mid-wicket region. Another run added to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Bouncer! The batsman ducks in time and lets it through to the keeper.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": "5,218,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Goes over the wicket, angles into the body of Imam who does well to stay tall and gets behind the line. He punches it from the back foot through the vacant cover region and takes three.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Steps out and smashes it hard again, but this time only manages to find the man at mid off.", "Summary": {"Score": "50/1", "Over": "11", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "27042", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "28", "Balls": "26", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "13", "Balls": "30", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66390", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,217,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "FOUR! Drills it and no need to run for that! Too full from Bess, Haris comes on the front foot and powers the drive through the covers. Splits the gap to perfection between extra cover and mid off. No stopping that one. 50 up for Pakistan, they just need 14 more to win this game!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Again too wide from Bess and the batsman is happy to leave those.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Quicker delivery outside off, left alone by the batsman.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,275,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "FOUR! Easy as you like. A loopy delivery on the stumps, Haris takes a step closer to it and makes contact on the full. Punches it with nice timing past his partner and beats the man at mid on. The ball races away for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Faster one from Bess and flatter too. Haris hangs back and decides to leave it all alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Imam is leaving the short ball outside the off stump with ease.", "Summary": {"Score": "42/1", "Over": "10", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63084", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "13", "Balls": "30", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "27042", "Runs": "20", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Another short one and the batsman shoulders arms to it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Repeat of the previous delivery from the batsman and the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Imam does well to get on his toes and plays the short ball down with soft hands.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Punches off the back foot to the mid-wicket region.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Short and touch close to the batsman's grille who does well to sway away from the line.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Stays tall and punches it back to the bowler with intent.", "Summary": {"Score": "42/1", "Over": "9", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "27042", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "20", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "13", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66390", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,204,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "FOUR! Touch short and Sohail punches this beautifully off the back foot through the covers and earns a boundary for the effort. Pakistan inch closer to the target.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Comes on the front foot and presents the full face as he defends.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Flighted and spinning away from the rough. Sohail happily leaves it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Driven off the front foot to mid off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,337,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Flatter on the leg stump. The batsman flicks it to the mid-wicket region and takes two.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Gets closer to the batsman with the short one. Imam takes evasive action and keeps his bat away from the delivery while swaying away.", "Summary": {"Score": "36/1", "Over": "8", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63084", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "13", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "27042", "Runs": "14", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Around the wicket on the same length, touch closer to the off stump this time. Imam sways away and leaves it for the keeper.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "A bumper from Wood, angling into the batsman. Imam is happy to duck under it and lets it go.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Short of a length angling away from the batsman. Imam gets high on his toes and plays it down to the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,12,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Pitched outside leg and angles on his pads. Sohail flicks it to square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Bangs the first one short and Sohail does well to duck underneath it. A quick one from Wood but Sohail plays it equally well.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Dual bowling change from England. Mark Wood comes into the attack. The hosts look bit desperate for the wickets, why not, they just have 29 runs to play with.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,335,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Sohail closes the face of the bat and works it in front of square leg for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "35/1", "Over": "7", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "27042", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "13", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "13", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66390", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "b", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Three Byes! Another one, turns away sharply and the batsman is beaten by it. Bairstow gets a glove on it but can't stop it cleanly. Stoneman from short third man chases it and pulls it inside the ropes to save a run for his side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,75,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "FOUR! Follows it up with a poor delivery, sliding it down the leg side. Imam-ul-Haq manages to get some wood on it and the ball rolls away to the fine leg boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Prodigious spin for Bess. He gives more revs to the ball. Imam goes for the drive but misses it. Bairstow takes it over his shoulders.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Loopy ball outside off, Imam plays a drive back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66390", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Flatter ball outside off, the batsman doesn't play at that one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Time for some spin. Dominic Bess gets the ball, can he do some magic with the cherry in his hand?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Another harmless delivery from Broad, outside off and Haris ignores it.", "Summary": {"Score": "27/1", "Over": "6", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "27042", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "12", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "9", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3840", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Too wide from Broad and the batsman decides to leave it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,204,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "FOUR! Overpitched delivery and Haris cashes on it. Fuller length ball on off, gets on the front foot and powers it between extra cover and mid off. A couple of boundaries in the over, Sohail is trying to stay positive.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Defends it down the track with a lot of ease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,124,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "FOUR! Uppish... but well over Stokes. Fuller length ball outside off stump, seeing width, Haris throws his bat at it and gets a thick outside edge over the slip cordon. No one at third man to stop it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Bowls from around the angle, a touch too wide, the batsman lets it go.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "The batsman chooses to leave the ball outside his off stump.", "Summary": {"Score": "19/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63084", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "9", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "27042", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3430", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Fuller length ball on off, plays a drive by going on one knee. Hits it to the man at mid off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,201,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Eases it on the off side and they take a quick single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": "5,201,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Plays a drive on the up through the covers. They scamper back for the third run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "The batsman chooses to leave the ball outside his off stump.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,342,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Run out chance? No, the fielder fails to gather the ball cleanly. Defends it on the leg side and calls for a quick single. Makes it as there is a fumble.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Beaten! Lovely delivery to end the over. Broad angles it across the stumps, Imam plays down the wrong line and misses it.", "Summary": {"Score": "14/1", "Over": "4", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63084", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "6", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsma