"Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "2,73,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Poor end to the over, Anderson slips it down the leg side. Haris moves inside the line of it and glances to fine leg for a brace.", "Summary": {"Score": "14/1", "Over": "3", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "27042", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "2", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3430", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Good ball, angling across and lifts sharply, the batsman lifts his bat and decides to leave it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "27042", "Commentary": "Wide outside off stump, the batsman leaves it alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Haris Sohail strides out to bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "OUT! Cleaned him up! Hitting the top of off, a dream delivery for any fast bowler. Anderson produces a beauty which sends Azhar Ali packing. Bowls it seam up and it is shaping in initially. The batsman plays for the angle but he is beaten as the ball straightens a bit and hits the top half of the off peg. Ali hears the sound of the timber and starts walking straightaway without looking back. Is there still a twist in the tale? Or is it too late for England? We will find that out soon...", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "11678", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,195,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Drop and run. This is brilliant from the left-hander. He drops it on the off side and calls for a quick single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Angling across the stumps, Imam doesn't offer a stroke to it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Bowls it touch fuller than the previous one. Ali comes on the front foot and defends it to the point region.", "Summary": {"Score": "11/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11678", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3840", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Length ball in the channel outside off, Ali covers his stumps and leaves it all alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Fuller length ball from Broad, seams in a little, Ali goes to play the drive but gets a thick inside edge on the back leg.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,19,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Plays with the straight bat but the ball goes off the inner half to deep square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,248,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "FOUR! Brilliant straight drive from Imam-ul-Haq, that will get him going. Fullish delivery from Broad, he leans forward and powers it to the left of mid off for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3840", "Batsman": "63084", "Commentary": "Tentatively played by Imam-ul-Haq. He gets a rising delivery, angling across him and he tries to play away from the body but gets beaten by the pace of Broad.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Stuart Broad will share the new ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,118,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "FOUR! Outside edge and it rolls wide of the third slip fielder. Four more for Pakistan. Ali hangs back and looks to defend that with hard hands. He gets a thick edge and the ball speeds away to the third man fence.", "Summary": {"Score": "6/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11678", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63084", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3430", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Good length ball outside off stump, Ali goes on the back foot and defends it on the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Two Leg Byes! Slipping down leg, Ali goes across to glance that but misses it. And gets hit on the thigh pad. Pakistan get underway in this run chase with a couple of leg byes.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "In the channel outside off, Azhar Ali covers his off stump and leaves it all alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Goes fuller this time and attacks the stumps, Ali hangs back in his crease and defends it on the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3430", "Batsman": "11678", "Commentary": "Anderson bowls a length ball outside off, Azhar goes back and plays away from the body as he defends it tentatively on the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 85, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:14:41 AM"}}}